  "summary": "Brief description of the content",
  "confidence": 0-1
}
`;
  } else {
    return basePrompt + `
Create an unstructured summary:
{
  "summary": "1-2 sentence summary of key points",
  "tone": "professional/casual/neutral",
  "importance": "high/medium/low",
  "confidence": 0-1
}
`;
